00:00:03.066 --> 00:00:06.360
MARTIN GORNER: So thank
you for filling the house.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.160
I'm really impressed
that TensorFlow

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.510
is getting so much attention.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.840
But I think the
technology deserves it.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:17.170
So I'm happy about that.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.790
So today, or yesterday,
